portant  to have tight security so that only the  people that need to have access to the  system  are able to gain and access to the  system  and they also focus on maintaining data  integrity throughout the system and  that's doing database maintenance and  nightly backups if there are any system  failures they'll be automatically  documented  and the i.t department will have  processes in place to address any  failures so that the system's back  online  in many cases if there's a failure today  the end user isn't even aware of it  because everything's handled in the  background  and then also it's important that all  the user manuals are available they're  either online or they're in pdf format  some people prefer  hard copies and then also any  calculations and data transfers are  validated  if there's an api in place and data is  being transferred or web services that's  all been  verified and validated before it's put  into production  so to summarize this presentation it's  really important to select the right  limbs for cannabis testing laboratory  having the right tools for analysts to  do their job not only makes them more  effective and productive  but it also increases their efficiency  it helps  contribute to high data integrity to  high data quality  eliminating mundane tasks such as  copying and pasting or re-entering data  or having to manually record  temperatures leads to higher  job satisfaction it's really important  to give people the right tools to do  their job  and for laboratories it not only  increases productivity but it also  increases profitability  additional benefits of limbs include  having a system where you can increase  communication in your organization  so instead of tracking down the lab  manager to check the status of the  sample  you can actually log into the limbs and  check on the status yourself  and also limbs and laboratory automation  provide a quick return on investment  when you can automate a mundane task  it's not only more efficient more  effective  but it also leads to higher data quality  it also  facilitates regulatory compliance as  you've seen over the past few slides  everything from managing corrective and  preventative actions  being compliant with electronic  signatures having security with windows  authentication  and also having a comprehensive internal  chain of custody and audit trail on all  the results  it really allows laboratories to be  bulletproof for their audits  with that i'd like to thank every thank  you so much for your time today  if you would like to receive a copy of  this presentation or our free limbs  guide roadmap to limb success  please don't hesitate to email info  atlab.com  or call us at 800 565 limbs  5467 or visit us on the web at atlab.com  thanks again and have a great day
 

